        "slc_e761ca59033df0abbe31d846d76a822b44c4738594652b71cb0b257646e80e9e"
      ],
      "text": "The team dashboard is a single-file HTML5 force-directed node graph (D3.js v7) where node size encodes stage progress, color encodes analysis type, and edges show follow-up or shared-tag connections; data comes from a bash export script emitting JSON."
    },
